00:02:11.320 --> 00:02:15.233
Masaaki Daimyo: Keisuke Shimizu Kazuya Aoyama: Masahiko Shimizu

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:19.599
TAJIMA Reiko: Saeko Kaneshiro MATSUSHITA Hiromi: Ikuko Miyajima

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:22.756
Akihiko Hirata: Dr.Hideto Miyajima; Hiroshi Koizumi: Dr.Wakura

